 days, you\u2019ll receive a <strong>hand-designed</strong> mock-up tailored to your vision via email.</p>\n<p><strong>No payment\u00a0</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>is required.</strong> You\u2019re not committing to anything yet, and there\u2019s no need for payment details at checkout. When you\u2019re ready to move forward, our <a href=\"https://fishcreekbrands.com/collections/create-your-custom-belt\">handmade needlepoint belts</a><a href=\"https://fishcreekbrands.com/products/custom-needlepoint-belt\"></a> cost $189</span>.</p>\n<p><strong>Have questions?</strong> We\u2019re happy to help! Email us at support@fishcreekbrands.com</p>", "published_at": "2024-04-08T22:32:33-06:00", "created_at": "2024-04-08T22:29:12-06:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T09:04:44-06:00", "vendor": "Fish Creek Brands", "product_type": "", "tags": ["needlepoint_belt"], "variants": [{"id": 48591292662057, "title": "Your Boat on a Belt", "option1": "Your Boat on a Belt", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": "FCB-BLT-CSTM-YACHT-PROOF", "requires_shipping": false, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 48354744041769, "product_id": 9103147041065, "position": 2, "created_at": "2024-10-30T18:01:25-06:00", "updated_at": "2025-03-11T19:16:39-06:00", "alt": null, "width": 1080, "height": 1080, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0832/7207/3513/files/Copy_of_Top_Performer_Paid.png?v=1741742199", "variant_ids": [48591292662057]}, "available": true, "price": "5.00", "grams": 340, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 9103147041065, "created_at": "2024-05-22T14:27:41-06:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T09:04:44-06:00"}, {"id": 48591292629289, "title": "Your Story on a Belt", "option1": "Your Story on a Belt", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": "FCB-BLT-CSTM-PROOF", "requires_shipping": false, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 49306124550441, "product_id": 9103147041065, "position": 1, "created_at": "2025-0